        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Production in a oil-furnace process - using natural gas as further energy input. The overall process yield is of 50%. Inventory bases on literature information about two different types of carbon black. Estimation of emission amount while composition is based on literature.\n\n# Included processes\nRaw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air and water from production (incomplete), estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes omitted.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
